01:04.065"><span begin="00:57.921" end="00:58.314">'Cause </span><span begin="00:58.314" end="00:58.817">darling </span><span begin="00:58.817" end="00:59.530">you're </span><span begin="00:59.530" end="01:01.133">all </span><span begin="01:01.353" end="01:02.762">I </span><span begin="01:03.009" end="01:04.065">need</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.426" end="01:07.212"><span begin="01:04.426" end="01:04.704">And </span><span begin="01:04.704" end="01:05.004">if </span><span begin="01:05.004" end="01:05.418">it's </span><span begin="01:05.418" end="01:06.161">not </span><span begin="01:06.161" end="01:07.212">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.649" end="01:10.322"><span begin="01:07.649" end="01:08.065">No </span><span begin="01:08.065" end="01:08.369">I'm </span><span begin="01:08.369" end="01:08.642">not </span><span begin="01:08.642" end="01:09.186">a </span><span begin="01:09.186" end="01:10.322">fool</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.841" end="01:17.161"><span begin="01:10.841" end="01:11.115">Just </span><span begin="01:11.115" end="01:11.699">wish </span><span begin="01:11.699" end="01:12.176">you </span><span begin="01:12.176" end="01:12.498">would </span><span begin="01:12.714" end="01:17.161">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.481" end="01:23.347"><span begin="01:17.481" end="01:17.729">You </span><span begin="01:17.729" end="01:18.074">know </span><span begin="01:18.185" end="01:18.449">that </span><span begin="01:18.618" end="01:18.841">it's </span><span begin="01:19.088" end="01:20.785">you </span><span begin="01:20.992" end="01:22.425">my </span><span begin="01:22.660" end="01:23.347">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.697" end="01:25.610"><span begin="01:23.697" end="01:24.025">Now </span><span begin="01:24.025" end="01:24.587">I </span><span begin="01:24.587" end="01:25.068">wanna </span><span begin="01:25.068" end="01:25.610">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.851" end="01:30.041"><span begin="01:25.851" end="01:27.209">How </span><span begin="01:27.464" end="01:28.625">you </span><span begin="01:28.954" end="01:30.041">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.411" end="01:33.148"><span begin="01:30.411" end="01:30.681">And </span><span begin="01:30.681" end="01:31.025">if </span><span begin="01:31.025" end="01:31.562">it's </span><span begin="01:31.562" end="01:31.932">not </span><span begin="01:32.241" end="01:33.148">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.755" end="01:36.523"><span begin="01:33.755" end="01:34.075">Don't </span><span begin="01:34.075" end="01:34.409">want </span><span begin="01:34.409" end="01:34.825">it </span><span begin="01:34.825" end="01:35.465">at </span><span begin="01:35.465" end="01:36.523">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.035" end="01:43.505"><span begin="01:37.035" end="01:37.354">Just </span><span begin="01:37.354" end="01:37.713">wish </span><span begin="01:37.713" end="01:38.137">you </span><span begin="01:38.137" end="01:38.449">would </span><span begin="01:38.713" end="01:40.378">hold </span><span begin="01:40.601" end="01:41.754">my </span><span begin="01:42.098" end="01:43.505">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.427" end="01:49.402"><span begin="01:45.427" end="01:46.589">Ooh </span><span begin="01:46.842" end="01:47.234">you </span><span begin="01:47.234" end="01:47.681">know </span><span begin="01:48.513" end="01:48.929">my </span><span begin="01:48.929" end="01:49.402">feelings</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.402" end="01:52.358"><span begin="01:49.402" end="01:50.051">Will </span><span begin="01:50.051" end="01:50.987">never </span><span begin="01:51.308" end="01:51.848">go </span><span begin="01:51.848" end="01:52.358">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.358" end="01:54.568"><span begin="01:52.358" end="01:53.238">For </span><span begin="01:53.238" end="01:54.568">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.153" end="01:59.199"><span begin="01:55.153"